// Ensemble prediction orchestrator with hierarchical model coordination
//
// DESIGN DECISIONS:
// - Hierarchical ensemble structure (base models -> specialization layers -> meta-ensemble)
// - Dynamic model weighting based on performance and market conditions
// - Real-time model health monitoring and adaptive selection
// - Uncertainty quantification and confidence intervals
// - Fallback mechanisms for model failures
//
// INTEGRATION POINTS:
// - specialization_layer_impl.rs (specialized predictions)
// - sector_model_trainer.rs (sector-specific models)
// - src/neural/fann_model_adapter.rs (base models)
// - src/integration/model_persistence_service.rs (model loading)
// - src/monitoring/health/component_checkers.rs (health monitoring)

